        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>

            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>填写时的三个判断</Text>

            <Box style={{ background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>答不出来的那一行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>就是这次任务的风险点，先补它。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>只列文件名不够</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>要写明材料从哪里取、哪些字段可用。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 18px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>写不清的未知项</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>要规定它在结果里怎么显示，标注为待核对。</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.2 Prompt：把愿望写成可以检查的任务</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>05 / 24</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
